# This file is documentation only under pnpm 11.
#
# pnpm >=11 reads settings from pnpm-workspace.yaml, not .npmrc. Verified:
# with every key below present, `pnpm config get link-workspace-packages`
# returned undefined and `pnpm config list` showed no publicHoistPattern. The
# two workspace-linking settings that used to live here now live in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, which is what made a plain
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` work again.
#
# public-hoist-pattern is deliberately NOT migrated. It was already inert under
# pnpm 11, so turning it back on here would change module resolution in a way
# nothing in this repo has validated. Move it to pnpm-workspace.yaml as
# `publicHoistPattern` as its own decision.
#
# store-dir is intentionally unset: it must stay machine-local (see
# ~/.config/pnpm/config.yaml). Committing an absolute store path breaks every
# new worktree when the repo lives on a different filesystem than the store --
# pnpm cannot hardlink across devices and silently falls back to full copies.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*babel*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*expo*
public-hoist-pattern[]=*metro*